context as @estimate_rules
    Keep the template's fields, six rows, and row order. Use nonnegative integer
    team scores; without team guidance use 0 for no meaningful work and 1–3 for
    increasing complexity. Explain zeros, avoid double-counting, and keep
    uncertainty in Risk & Unknowns. Total Complexity Score is the exact sum.
    Final Estimate is a supported numeric judgment ending in SP, with no invented
    score-to-SP formula. Complete estimates include Overall Reason and contain
    no placeholders or unsupported claims.
